Conflicts: picompose-audio-driver
Replaces: picompose-audio-driver
Description: PiCompose driver for the ReSpeaker 2-Mics Pi HAT (version 1)
 Boot configuration for the ReSpeaker 2-Mics Pi HAT, which has a WM8960
 codec. The kernel of Raspberry Pi OS has the driver for the codec and the
 overlay wm8960-soundcard, so no kernel module is built. The package enables
 I2C and SPI (for the LEDs of the HAT) and loads the overlay in the boot
 configuration. A service switches on the routing of the codec, which
 otherwise starts silent.
 .
 The package provides picompose-audio-driver, so only one audio driver package
 can be installed.
